('KAKAO-5060544365', '카르페디엠(Carpe Diem)', 'ko', 'other', '파타야CC 그린 상태 너무 나빠요', '8월 31일 파타야CC 그린이 울퉁불퉁하고 느려요. 모래가 많고 잔디가 없는 곳도 있어요. 골프장에 꼭 전달해 주세요.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'high', NULL, '2026-09-03 01:01:15+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_wave4_20261004', '2026-08-31 19:06:42+07', '2026-09-03 01:01:15+07'),
('MANUAL-1788772818400-ff7rssh', 'Hiro Aratake', 'en', 'caddy_booking', 'Why is booking at Eastern Star so slow?', 'Every JOA day at Eastern Star it''s the same: call, wait, call back, wait. 5 Sep took three days to confirm one caddy. Please get Eastern Star onto the app.', 'JOA Golf Pattaya', 'resolved', 'high', NULL, '2026-09-03 07:34:18+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_wave4_20261004', '2026-08-31 15:14:36+07', '2026-09-03 07:34:18+07'),
('TRGG-GUEST-0772', 'Opic, Brittany', 'en', 'other', 'Should we keep Pattaya CC on the schedule?', 'With the greens the way they are, is the TRGG keeping Pattaya CC every Monday? Several of us are thinking of dropping 31 Aug unless the course says what they''re doing about the back nine.', 'Travellers Rest Golf Group', 'resolved', 'high', NULL, '2026-08-30 14:51:42+07', 'U2b6d976f19bca4b2f4374ae0e10ed873', 'seed_wave4_20261004', '2026-08-30 11:58:25+07', '2026-08-30 14:51:42+07'),
